                        ],
                        "form": "ту́постях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be0b1af8-0f46-32e0-a22d-114959dc3396",
                        "entry_id": "6a672ca1-550e-3ade-8ba8-816150d4eb91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного тупой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f883813d-9913-4dc4-8bd2-80420923beb2",
                                "sense_id": "be0b1af8-0f46-32e0-a22d-114959dc3396",
                                "text": "При исследованиях расстройств аффективной сферы выделяется также «эмоциональная тупость» как расстройство с крайней слабостью эмоциональных реакций (либо полным отсутствием) и эмоциональной холодностью."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b35cc023-0c6a-3068-a194-11342afdb2d5",
                        "entry_id": "6a672ca1-550e-3ade-8ba8-816150d4eb91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. то же, что глупость; неспособность понять, сообразить что-либо; также проявление такого свойства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53c19168-8a14-4f85-b33c-e2fa764a6c06",
                                "sense_id": "b35cc023-0c6a-3068-a194-11342afdb2d5",
                                "text": "А эта комичная надзирательница доводила нас до смеха и видом своим несуразным, и неумелой суровостью, и удивительной тупостью."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8381425e-fd94-4c0c-9e26-afabe090be4b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a672ca1-550e-3ade-8ba8-816150d4eb91",
                        "target_lang_word": "bluntness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bluntness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b65a8981-cd85-3c26-be97-9b49f88f3089",
                                        "entry_id": "87b98657-a48e-3caf-9d87-c98d81f77974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic of being blunt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bae4f9a0-6991-4aa4-9221-ca5f319273fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b65a8981-cd85-3c26-be97-9b49f88f3089",
                                                "text": "All this was extraordinarily distasteful to Churchill. It was ugly, gross. Never before had he felt such repulsion when the vicar displayed his characteristic bluntness or coarseness of speech. In the present connexion […] such talk had been distressingly out of place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2cdba356-ed78-4afa-b00c-47365f12c79d",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a672ca1-550e-3ade-8ba8-816150d4eb91",
                        "target_lang_word": "dullness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dullness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1a5ecf4-db3a-3891-92da-2fb80a2f9bf7",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being slow of understanding things; stupidity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "230fa280-ce7d-3cf5-943e-1446e12bd546",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being uninteresting; boring; humorless or irksome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9eae842-3b2a-4dde-9451-0191c4d27b66",
                                                "sense_id": "230fa280-ce7d-3cf5-943e-1446e12bd546",
                                                "text": "If to raise malicious smiles at the infirmities or misfortunes of those who have never injured us be the province of wit or Humour, Heaven grant me a double Portion of Dullness—"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b94769bf-51cb-3f2f-af31-15a21321f48c",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lack of interest or excitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7f70f71-2bb7-392a-9ddb-1a273dbbf141",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lack of visual brilliance; want of sheen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ad8e207-7d45-47e3-8180-59e2a5d5e6eb",
                                                "sense_id": "a7f70f71-2bb7-392a-9ddb-1a273dbbf141",
                                                "text": "dullness of autumn"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d666009-b4a3-32a2-b985-e9eee4c3335a",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "bluntness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f409a5a0-b913-30f7-a144-e2aa94056048",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of not perceiving or kenning things distinctly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f2e0863-2cbb-4687-a6d8-79fb0a569c39",
                                                "sense_id": "f409a5a0-b913-30f7-a144-e2aa94056048",
                                                "text": "dullness of sight, or of hearing"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "572b30c9-72f3-3661-9606-15b65cfc82f3",
                                        "entry_id": "7ab4bf01-7cf6-32c1-a443-3c46534f99ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Drowsiness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8f2ca56-8d54-4dba-a99d-30c018943622",
                                                "sense_id": "572b30c9-72f3-3661-9606-15b65cfc82f3",
                                                "text": "Prospero: […]Thou art inclin'd to sleep. 'Tis a good dulness, / And give it way— I know thou canst not choose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e03f2142-c916-4840-b7e8-7f43298e160a",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a672ca1-550e-3ade-8ba8-816150d4eb91",
                        "target_lang_word": "stupidity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stupidity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "072a3d7d-6ff5-3a40-8566-124fc5662f87",
                                        "entry_id": "44f4e45f-b2b2-33e4-b4e7-8b7235bccdf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The property of being stupid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1f608d-64aa-4ebe-a084-c4cc0a076684",
                                                "sense_id": "072a3d7d-6ff5-3a40-8566-124fc5662f87",
                                                "text": "I suppose you can put it down to gross stupidity, but that's not much of an excuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7326125d-66d4-486b-beed-5a78d23abb45",
                                                "sense_id": "072a3d7d-6ff5-3a40-8566-124fc5662f87",
                                                "text": "And Vickers launched forth into a tirade very different from his platform utterances. He spoke with extreme contempt of the dense stupidity exhibited on all occasions by the working classes. He said that if you wanted to do anything for them, you must rule them, not pamper them. Soft heartedness caused more harm than good."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d548616e-b335-328e-b034-e4dcdeff84f5",
                                        "entry_id": "44f4e45f-b2b2-33e4-b4e7-8b7235bccdf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act that is stupid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "299ef560-36cd-4e25-8d1d-8b6d21083b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "d548616e-b335-328e-b034-e4dcdeff84f5",
                                                "text": "Jimmy's stupidity cost him his car."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81d94253-4d45-4c29-a849-5474c3e9b753",
                                                "sense_id": "d548616e-b335-328e-b034-e4dcdeff84f5",
                                                "text": "8. They require that crass stupidities shall not be played upon the reader as “the craft of the woodsman, the delicate art of the forest,” by either the author or the people in the tale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
